    "en": {
      "trackName": "Lockstep: Bead Puzzle",
      "description": "Lockstep: Bead Puzzle is a calm game about moving everything at once.\n\nSwipe, and every bead on the board takes one step in that direction. A bead stops when a wall, the edge or another bead is in the way, and that's how you pull them apart. Get each bead onto its matching ring.\n\n• Hand-made cards from Beginner to Expert, each checked by a solver. Par is the fewest swipes possible; match it for three stars.\n• A Daily card, the same for everyone, with a streak to keep. Send it to a friend: they can play it straight from the link, even without the app.\n• Endless run: puzzles get harder, and swipes over par spend your spares.\n• Shuffle: a fresh puzzle at any difficulty, whenever you want one.\n• Arrows, holes, and a secret deck for those who clear every Expert card.\n• Hints that point the way without giving it away.\n• Plays on iPhone, iPad, Mac, Apple TV and Apple Watch, with progress synced through iCloud.\n• Game Center leaderboards and achievements.\n\nFree to play: the Daily card, the Beginner and Intermediate cards, and Beginner Shuffle. Lockstep Complete, a one-time purchase, unlocks Advanced and Expert cards, the secret deck, Endless and every Shuffle level, on all your devices and for your family.\n\nTry today's card free in your browser at lockstepgame.com.\n\nNo ads. No tracking. No subscription.",
